      150     define buffer c-price-doc-forming-gds-sum for ub.c-price-doc-forming-gds-sum.
      151   on delete of ub.c-price-doc-forming-gds-sum override do: end.
      152   for each c-price-doc-forming-gds-sum exclusive-lock
      153       where c-price-doc-forming-gds-sum.plt-id     = price-doc-forming.plt-id       and c-price-doc-forming-gds-sum.plt-db-num = price-doc-forming.plt-db-num       and c-price-doc-forming-gds-sum.pdf-id     = price-doc-forming.pdf-id       and c-price-doc-forming-gds-sum.pdf-db     = price-doc-forming.pdf-db
      154   on error undo, return error
