      161     define buffer price-doc-forming-gds-tnv for ub.price-doc-forming-gds-tnv.
      162   on delete of ub.price-doc-forming-gds-tnv override do: end.
      163   for each price-doc-forming-gds-tnv exclusive-lock
      164       where price-doc-forming-gds-tnv.plt-id     = price-doc-forming.plt-id       and price-doc-forming-gds-tnv.plt-db-num = price-doc-forming.plt-db-num       and price-doc-forming-gds-tnv.pdf-id     = price-doc-forming.pdf-id       and price-doc-forming-gds-tnv.pdf-db     = price-doc-forming.pdf-db
