      173   on delete of ub.c-price-doc-forming-gds-tnv override do: end.
      174   for each c-price-doc-forming-gds-tnv exclusive-lock
      175       where c-price-doc-forming-gds-tnv.plt-id     = price-doc-forming.plt-id       and c-price-doc-forming-gds-tnv.plt-db-num = price-doc-forming.plt-db-num       and c-price-doc-forming-gds-tnv.pdf-id     = price-doc-forming.pdf-id       and c-price-doc-forming-gds-tnv.pdf-db     = price-doc-forming.pdf-db
      176   on error undo, return error
      177   :
